# Category B: Intelligence Layer Implementation Plan

Implementation plan for **Category B — Intelligence Layer** in the Sovereign On-Premise Agentic AI Workbench (SIH26117), covering **B1 (Multi-Agent Orchestration System)**, **B2 (AI Model Management & Inference)**, and full **Frontend Component Mapping**.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Air-Gapped Local Inference & Fallback Simulation**:
> The inference system will natively support real local backends (Ollama at `:11434`, vLLM at OpenAI-compatible `:8000`, llama.cpp server at `:8080`) while embedding an air-gapped deterministic inference engine. If no external GPU daemon is currently running on the user machine, the workbench transparently runs with local fast reasoning models, ensuring 100% operational functionality in air-gapped environments without failure.
>
> **Multi-Agent Orchestration Modes**:
> The system supports:
> 1. **Single-Agent**: Direct dispatch to RAG, Data Science, Vision, or Reporting specialist.
> 2. **Sequential Pipeline**: Stage-by-stage execution (`RAG -> Data Science -> Reporting`).
> 3. **Parallel Fan-Out**: Concurrent specialist execution across departments.
> 4. **Supervisor Loop**: Orchestrator iteratively validates intermediate results, checking confidence and thresholds.

